\v 18 [Thou wilt surely]{strong=“H5034” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [wear away]{strong=“H5034” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [both thou, and this people]{strong=“H5971”} that is [with thee: for this thing]{strong=“H1697”} is \w too heavy| strong="H3515" \w* [for thee; thou art not able]{strong=“H3201” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to perform]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} it thyself alone.\f + \fr 18:18 \ft Thou wilt…: Heb. Fading thou wilt fade \f* 
