\v 15 \w And Moses| strong="H4872" \w* [went up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into the mount| strong="H2022" \w*, \w and a cloud| strong="H6051" \w* [covered]{strong=“H3680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w the mount| strong="H2022" \w*. 
